              "validate_encoding": "EncodingClasses validationMeaning/keysMeaning preserve nonempty distinct source/support, equal row count, exact origin-set coverage, unique origins and supported codewords. Empty source strings and empty codeword lists remain legal values; no extra guards.",
              "source_classes": "EncodingClasses firstCodewords/retainFirst preserve first-use encoding word order; membersFor preserves every source occurrence in order using exact pair membership. classMeaning/memberMeaning, distinct keys, source provenance and admitted nonemptiness proved.",
